      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1CH",
          "chapter": 19,
          "verse": 8
        }
      ],
      "en": "When David heard of it, he sent Joab with all the army of the mighty men.",
      "ko": "다윗이 듣고 요압과 용사의 온 무리를 보내었더니",
      "source_text_hash": "a59295c94870e2f657444b409d634628aed92e44d919f097d9af761acac227e5",
      "translation_text_hash": "629c2f1a44f009c0ecfc17f86a13db863a948b5c1d6c1ead8bc235bd759c4b4e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "다윗이 듣고 요압과 용사의 온 무리를 보내었더니"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "629c2f1a44f009c0ecfc17f86a13db863a948b5c1d6c1ead8bc235bd759c4b4e"
      ]
    },
    {
