      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "1CH",
          "chapter": 19,
          "verse": 9
        }
      ],
      "en": "The children of Ammon came out, and put the battle in array at the gate of the city; and the kings who had come were by themselves in the field.",
      "ko": "암몬 자손은 나와서 성문 앞에 진 치고 도우러 온 여러 왕은 따로 들에 있더라",
      "source_text_hash": "6ab844c90d9dbcfe44e36920275fd2b824af3939503e35db977b2ee2c1a7c141",
      "translation_text_hash": "3f3847075e673ef71b3c1cbe2147ef6acbdf804437f8766f5680d544e28643c7",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "암몬 자손은 나와서 성문 앞에 진 치고 도우러 온 여러 왕은 따로 들에 있더라"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "3f3847075e673ef71b3c1cbe2147ef6acbdf804437f8766f5680d544e28643c7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:1CH:19:10",
      "sequence": 10918,
